{"id":"n75754-2-7","stage":1,"title":"재미 · 意思","scene":"人物与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n75754-2-7-1","ko":"할머니, 요즘 손자를 봐서 재미가 좋으시죠?","zh":"奶奶，最近照顾孙子一定很开心吧？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"할머니,","meaning":"奶奶，姥姥","explanation":"할머니：奶奶，姥姥。","readings":[{"term":"할머니","audio":"/audio/8dc4d6918deb0b6e1d10.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27375","senseId":"1","lemma":"할머니","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"할머니","audio":"/audio/8dc4d6918deb0b6e1d10.mp3"}},{"text":"요즘","meaning":"最近，近来，这阵子","explanation":"요즘：最近，近来，这阵子。","readings":[{"term":"요즘","audio":"/audio/828c4030dd68aa7bc886.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20250","senseId":"1","lemma":"요즘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"요즘","audio":"/audio/828c4030dd68aa7bc886.mp3"}},{"text":"손자를","meaning":"孙子，外孙","explanation":"손자：孙子，外孙；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"손자","audio":"/audio/663ded26798b941a6332.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"63880","senseId":"1","lemma":"손자","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"손자를","audio":"/audio/1b2699ae96b474866f95.mp3"}},{"text":"봐서","meaning":"照顾，看，看护","explanation":"보다：照顾，看，看护；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。","readings":[{"term":"보다","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61190","senseId":"10","lemma":"보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"봐서","audio":"/audio/166d265d4dfd37db3f1c.mp3"}},{"text":"재미가","meaning":"意思，开心","explanation":"재미：意思，开心；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"재미","audio":"/audio/1ad5f1ed1dfcf49c8405.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"75754","senseId":"2","lemma":"재미","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"재미가","audio":"/audio/2f397a46e78543add1e3.mp3"}},{"text":"좋으시죠?","meaning":"好，高兴，愉快","explanation":"좋다：好，高兴，愉快；으시：主语敬语，尊敬动作或状态的主体；죠：礼貌地确认、提醒或表达意愿；죠 是 지요 的缩略。","readings":[{"term":"좋다","audio":"/audio/86d0464f1c6da40233cd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"79033","senseId":"11","lemma":"좋다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"좋으시죠","audio":"/audio/5e1d40a78cfaaeac0385.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"8dc4d6918deb0b6e","term":"할머니","zh":"奶奶，姥姥","audio":"/audio/8dc4d6918deb0b6e1d10.mp3","entryId":"27375","definition":"用于指称或称呼父亲的母亲或母亲的母亲。","pronunciation":["할머니"]},{"id":"828c4030dd68aa7b","term":"요즘","zh":"最近，近来，这阵子","audio":"/audio/828c4030dd68aa7bc886.mp3","entryId":"20250","definition":"从非常近的过去到现在之间。","pronunciation":["요즘"]},{"id":"663ded26798b941a","term":"손자","zh":"孙子，外孙","audio":"/audio/663ded26798b941a6332.mp3","entryId":"63880","definition":"儿子的儿子；或指女儿的儿子。","pronunciation":["손자"]},{"id":"6a45cf834264a5ec","term":"보다","zh":"照顾，看，看护","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3","entryId":"61190","definition":"保护或照料某人。","pronunciation":["보다"]},{"id":"1ad5f1ed1dfcf49c","term":"재미","zh":"意思，开心","audio":"/audio/1ad5f1ed1dfcf49c8405.mp3","entryId":"75754","definition":"在问候语中，询问的某事或生活的情况。","pronunciation":["재미"]},{"id":"86d0464f1c6da402","term":"좋다","zh":"好，高兴，愉快","audio":"/audio/86d0464f1c6da40233cd.mp3","entryId":"79033","definition":"感情等很愉悦、很满足。","pronunciation":["조ː타"]}],"audio":"/audio/6f581e23fc5e4f83c0dc.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n75754-2-7-2","ko":"그럼. 손자가 있으니 시간 가는 줄도 모르겠어.","zh":"那当然。有孙子在，时间过得飞快呢。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"그럼.","meaning":"可不是，就是，当然","explanation":"그럼：可不是，就是，当然。","readings":[{"term":"그럼","audio":"/audio/86f87d3fb9919f145d21.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62277","senseId":"1","lemma":"그럼","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"그럼","audio":"/audio/86f87d3fb9919f145d21.mp3"}},{"text":"손자가","meaning":"孙子，外孙","explanation":"손자：孙子，外孙；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"손자","audio":"/audio/663ded26798b941a6332.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"63880","senseId":"1","lemma":"손자","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"손자가","audio":"/audio/1d495ea5c74610b23681.mp3"}},{"text":"있으니","meaning":"有","e