"있다","zh":"有","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3","entryId":"68797","definition":"人或动物、物体等存在的状态。","pronunciation":["읻따"]},{"id":"4692cef5ac69eb37","term":"시간","zh":"时间","audio":"/audio/4692cef5ac69eb37bd53.mp3","entryId":"62841","definition":"从某一时候到另一时候的期间。","pronunciation":["시간"]},{"id":"233cb510410b09d6","term":"가다","zh":"过","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3","entryId":"27500","definition":"时间经过或消逝。","pronunciation":["가다"]},{"id":"4e04e3938cc9c67e","term":"줄","zh":"事情、情况（-는 줄 모르다：没意识到……）","audio":"/audio/4e04e3938cc9c67ed71b.mp3","entryId":"91870","definition":"事情、情况（-는 줄 모르다：没意识到……）","pronunciation":["줄"]},{"id":"20ef19694f337fd4","term":"모르다","zh":"不知道，不认识，不懂","audio":"/audio/20ef19694f337fd42539.mp3","entryId":"29712","definition":"不清楚或不了解人或事物、事实等。","pronunciation":["모ː르다"]}],"audio":"/audio/432c4e1df4bd03465e27.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.568,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=75754","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"2","sourceLevel":"초급","day":48,"sequenceScore":2.1201,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["奶奶，最近照顾孙子很辛苦吧？","奶奶，最近照顾孙子一定很开心吧？","奶奶，您是不是希望将来能有孙子？"],"answer":1},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["当然，有孙子在就觉得时间特别难熬。","不，我觉得没有孙子的日子更快乐。","那当然。有孙子在，时间过得飞快呢。"],"answer":2}]}
